OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fto start with patchy rain, but a fine
OL,7,Fend to Sunday. Fine and dry on Monday
OL,8,Fbefore a cloudier day on Tuesday.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average. Generally
OL,10,Flight winds.
